    },
    {
      "text": "Heat ½ inch oil in a deep fryer to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Drop batter by spoonfuls into hot oil; fry until evenly browned and fluffy. Drain on a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
